STRING 1104
{
This is a CRASH FIX version. However, there are some more changes.

Crashfix:
 - Fixed a crash caused by Thorns Aura.
 - Unholy Frenzy can once again be cast on Runeblades.
 - Fixed Great Axe vitality talent.
General:
 - Fixed several passive abilities unintentionally giving 15% Evasion.
 - Gladiators can no longer attack items.
Enchants:
 - Charge Range increased from 1600 to 1750.
 - When the Audience are bored of your tactics, your team will lose a significant amount of upgrade points.
 - Control Points that are fully charged (i.e. 2/2 Enchants) will lose 200 charge after each round.
 - Enchants now have an item description.
 - Fixed Enchant: Blood's mana-steal not working when at full hit points.
}
STRING 1830
{
To encourage fair teamplay you can request to borrow gold from teammates. To do this, type '-borrow xxxx' where xxxx is an amount from 1 to 9999. This begins a 12 second window where other players can type '-loan xxxx' to give you the gold you want. Some tips to note about this system:
 - Payback is automatic and is done before and after rounds start
 - Type '-debts' to show what you owe other players
 - Type '-dues' to show what other players owe you
 - If you type -loan without specifying an amount, you will automatically try to meet the request
}
