STRING 2610
{
Fixes:
 - Fixed an error where +200 EXP existed twice in the possible reward pool.
 - You can no longer pick Crystal Ball after being force randomed a hero.
 - Fixed Enchant: Blood's mana-steal from effecting all units.
 - Spamming -repick no longer clears the EXP -repick penalty on your next pick.
 - The central control point (Hill: Fire) has moved location to prevent overlap with top left and top right.
Wave Changes:
 - Movement Speed has been normalized within waves. Wave 1 starts at 200 movement speed, and each wave thereafter gains 10 more movement speed, up to a cap of 320. This is an overall nerf to early game waves, a slight buff to mid game waves and does not effect the end game waves.
 - Attack Range (of ranged creeps) has been normalized within and across waves. Wave 1 starts at 240 range, and each wave thereafter gains 30 more attack range. Wave 20 has the highest ranged attackers of 810. This is a nerf to early game waves but a strong buff to mid and end game waves.
 - Above changes also applies to Bosses. Do note that some bosses/creeps have abilities that may increase their attack range or movement speed above or below the expected amount (e.g. Wildkin Boss).
 - All bosses of the same wave share the same effective HP; this means their HP/DMG gained per player and armour type are the same. This is to ensure all boss base stats are balanced and to help avoid situations where 1 alternate wave is more powerful than the other.
 - The armour gain of bosses has been adjusted. Bosses 1-9 gain a minor armour bonus per player in the game whilst Bosses 10-19 gain a moderate armour bonus. Boss 20's stats have been unchanged.
 - Collision Size follows this rule for creeps: Spawn Size 1 = 16, Spawn Size 2 or 3 = 24, Spawn Size 4 = 32.
 - To help assist with AI pathing, Player 11 (formerly Jailers) is now Monsters (identical to Player 12). Monsters that spawn on the East and West will be owned by Player 11 whilst Player 12 will own North and all bosses. Please keep an eye out for bugs as some of the creep coding was based around Player 12 and not Players 11 and 12.
 - (REQUIRES TESTING) Monsters that spawn North will attempt to use the Fountain's right entrance when the players are based there.
SCYTHE:
 - Golem Stats reduced by 30%.
 - Flesh Golem's Blood Strike area of effect reduced by 30%.
 - Soul Harvest does 100% more damage.
DRUID:
 - Gnarly Bark gives +100% thorns damage instead of +300%.
 - Wither's damage reduced by 20%.
 - Starfall mana cost reduced by 25.
WAR DRUMS:
 - Comradeship now reduces Inspire's cooldown by 30 seconds instead of 60.
HELL MODE:
 - Hell Mode follows a preset sequence of waves to keep the difficulty balanced and predictable. 
 - After 120 seconds all wave creeps will Enrage (down from 180 seconds).
 - After 180 seconds the scroll shop will despawn.
REWARDS:
 - Added missing hybrids for +50 HP, +25 Gold, +5 Damage and +100 EXP.
 - (Requires Testing) Fixes for +50 HP hybrid rewards.
}
