STRING 3171
{
Player 1 only:
-oldwaves (game will follow old wave structure)
-waves2 (game will follow new wave structure 1)
-waves3 (game will follow new wave structure 2)
-normal (sets difficulty to normal)
-nightmare (sets difficulty to nightmare)
-hell (Hell must be enabled. Sets difficulty to hell)
-ar (players can only random from the racks)
-ban 'weapon name' (weapon cannot be picked or randomed)
}
