STRING 4776
{
|cffffcc00Tips for beginners|r:
 - You gain skills as you level up
 - You get lumber on hero levels 8, 10, 12, 14 etc.
 - EXP share is global and you still get EXP if dead
 - Gold is gained at the end of the wave
 - The first 10 waves are easier than the last 10
 - If there are leavers, the game will scale accordingly.

Join the https://discord.gg/c5rwpZX to meet with other players, suggest improvements, report bugs and to organise timed runs!
}
