STRING 8769
{
-nospam (filters some unimportant game messages)
-clear (clears game messages from your screen)
-damage (reports total damage done for all players)
-healed (reports total healing done for all players)
-bossdmg (reports total damage done to bosses for all players)
-tanked (reports total hits taken for all players)
-z.far (zooms the camera out far)
-upgrades (shows progress towards next Upgrade)
-players (lists player name vs. player number)
-debts (shows debts towards players)
-dues (shows expected dues from players)
-borrow xxxx (request to borrow gold)
-loan xxxx (loan gold in response to -borrow)
}
